# Maven Default Build Options
# ===========================
# These options are automatically applied to every mvnw command.
#
# -T 1C:
#   Use one build thread per available CPU core. This helps most on larger or
#   multi-module builds, and is safe to keep as a default here.
#
# -Dmaven.artifact.threads=20:
#   Allow Maven to resolve artifacts in parallel during dependency downloads.
#
# --no-transfer-progress:
#   Keep console output readable in local runs and CI logs.
-T 1C
-Dmaven.artifact.threads=20
--no-transfer-progress
